      "name": "Original fixtures; displacement and association contracts",
      "description": "Original synthetic images, fields and project: OpenCVDataflowGUI contributors, MIT. No third-party/customer images. Analytic truth is dx=3, dy=-2 local pixels. Computed field uses Farneback; its error is measured against independent analytic truth. Roundtrip writes a fresh UUID-named .flo plus SHA-bound image-pair manifest into the ignored output folder, reloads with image verification and warps the source. Bare file has no direction/pair provenance. Direction mismatch and wrong image deliberately stop Warp as invalid, with no image emission. Fingerprints establish pixel/grid identity, not camera identity, acquisition timing, visibility or motion accuracy.",
